    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58957" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοπεύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one
				who brays</i> or <i>pounds</i>, employed in oil-factories,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>PRev.Laws</u>
				45.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Agatharch.
				26
			</span></i>; <i>carpenter,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				175.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>: generally, <i>one who cuts</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				301.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>chisel</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Somn.</u>
				13
			</span></i>.</div>
